   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "In a physical sense, we can see:\n",
    "\n",
    "- the variance being the spread of the mass\n",
    "- the mean being the center of the mass\n",
    "\n",
    "![Physical Metaphor](../../assets/variance_physical_metaphor.png)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7868f042",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "In Pandas, we simply call the `describe` method on the column (series), to get all these statistics:"
