  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "26d04d5a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Variation 2: Ridgeline Plot\n",
    "\n",
    "A [**Ridgeline plot**](https://www.data-to-viz.com/graph/ridgeline.html) (sometimes called **Joyplot**) shows the distribution of a numeric value for several groups. Distribution can be represented using histograms or density plots, all aligned to the same horizontal scale and presented with a slight overlap.\n",
    "\n",
    "![Ridge Plot of Temperature in Lincoln NE in 2016](../../assets/ridgeplot_temperature_in_lincoln_ne_in_2016.png){height=480}"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3f215268",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Other Distributions"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4080db76",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "![Histogram Distributions](../../assets/histogram_distributions.png){height=600}"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5903a308",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "We describe the distribtuion using these vocabularies:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Normal: symmetric triangle\n",
    "2. Uniform: even, like a brush\n",
    "3. Left-skewed: right-angle triangle\n",
    "4. Right-skewed: left-angle triangle\n",
    "5. Bimodal: two normals together\n",
    "6. Multi-modal: many normals together"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
